00:09:27.304 --> 00:09:28.500
Our first in the state

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.405
automated speed cameras have

00:09:30.874 --> 00:09:31.509
been operating in a no fee

00:09:31.509 --> 00:09:33.909
