00:09:39.516 --> 00:09:42.686
And the S.F. Mta has led the

00:09:42.686 --> 00:09:43.387
way in advancing safe street

00:09:43.387 --> 00:09:46.387
designs redesigns and just a

00:09:46.457 --> 00:09:47.158
couple of weeks ago supervisor

00:09:47.158 --> 00:09:50.294
you walton you and I cut the

00:09:50.294 --> 00:09:50.962
ribbon on the potrero gateway a

00:09:50.962 --> 00:09:52.962
transformative streetscape

00:09:53.764 --> 00:09:54.499
projected project that widened

00:09:54.499 --> 00:09:56.899
