00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:06.144
We're going to keep doing

00:10:06.144 --> 00:10:08.179
whatever it takes to keep our

00:10:08.179 --> 00:10:10.214
residents and visitors safe

00:10:10.214 --> 00:10:10.882
and that means using all the

00:10:10.882 --> 00:10:11.215
